From 5f89db221df38e0103ed421b6e23ffeac818bbac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Mar 2026 09:05:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 202/913] clk: stm32mp25: add critical clock flag from common
 clock framework

Prepare the new management of critical clocks by using the
CLK_IS_CRITICAL flag from the common clock framework.

This will allow marking STM32 clocks that must never be disabled.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f32c8f56925b7eeeb49eb87efe874d63f8fae430 clk: stm32mp25: add critical clock flag from common clock framework]
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I8bf870afc2f662e15cb0889d6b0c87b8b646557b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/545789
---
